      <li><a href="#60-day-reporting" class="hover:underline text-link dark:text-link">5. HMRC 60-Day CGT Property Reporting</a></li>
      <li><a href="#let-property-campaign" class="hover:underline text-link dark:text-link">6. HMRC Let Property Campaign & Disclosure</a></li>
      <li><a href="#gains-life-insurance" class="hover:underline text-link dark:text-link">7. Gains on Life Insurance Policies & Shares</a></li>
